  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "偷偷出院与收视大捷  (Sneaking Home and a Ratings Triumph)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 17 of Behind the Scenes. Having sneaked out of the hospital to his apartment, Chun Yuqiao gets a surprise call that Xingtian's chairwoman is right outside his door while Bu Xiaogu is visiting. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对，我从医院逃出来了，刚准备联系你呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们已经在我家门口了？行，稍等一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "完了，我该怎么办啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要是发现我在你家，那可怎么办呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你先去我家卧室待着，千万别出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢大家的肯定，这都是我应该做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次台网联合直播实验成功了，我也很高兴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还是要感谢电视台还有公司能够给我这样一个机会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "董事长，能不能把你的电话借给我用一下？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "从我住院之后，有一个人就一直不再接我电话了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对，我从医院逃出来了，刚准备联系你呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I sneaked out of the hospital and was just about to contact you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们已经在我家门口了？行，稍等一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are already outside my front door? Alright, wait just a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "完了，我该怎么办啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh no, what am I supposed to do now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要是发现我在你家，那可怎么办呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What if the chairwoman discovers I am here at your place?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你先去我家卧室待着，千万别出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go stay inside my bedroom for now and do not come out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢大家的肯定，这都是我应该做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all for the recognition; I was only doing my job.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次台网联合直播实验成功了，我也很高兴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am very glad our joint television-and-online broadcast experiment succeeded.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还是要感谢电视台还有公司能够给我这样一个机会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Above all, I want to thank the station and the company for giving me this opportunity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "董事长，能不能把你的电话借给我用一下？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, may I borrow your phone for a moment?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "从我住院之后，有一个人就一直不再接我电话了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ever since I was hospitalised, there is someone who stopped answering my calls.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
